"animation":"","paddingsection":"0px 0px 30px 0px","paddingmobile":"0px 0px 30px 0px","marginsection":"0px 0px 0px 0px","marginmobile":"0px 0px 0px 0px","bgsection":"#fefefe","bgstyle":false,"bgbefore":"#e3c9b8","title_top":"","title":"","des":"","setwidth":"container","no_gutter":false,"show_overlay":false,"gradient_overlay":false,"bg_overlay":"#000000","opacity_overlay":0.4}},"product-grid":{"type":"collection-template-8","settings":{"collection_width":"container","products_per_page":20,"collection_perrow":"4","enable_filtering":true,"enable_sorting":true,"enable_filtering_sidebar":false,"collapse_on_larger_devices":false,"enable_color":true,"style_color":"color_list","padding_top":0,"padding_bottom":0}},"rich_text_xL9V39":{"type":"rich-text","disabled":true,"settings":{"animation":"","paddingsection":"0px 0px 0px 0px","paddingmobile":"60px 0px 60px 0px","marginsection":"0px 0px 0px 0px","marginmobile":"0px 0px 0px 0px","bgsection":"#fefefe","title_top":"","title":"","des":"","setwidth":"container","text":"<p>Plantar fasciitis is a dull to severe pain in your heel caused by a strain and inflammation of your plantar fascia. The plantar fascia is a scientific name for ”foot tissue.“ This particular tissue is a ligament attached at one side to the heel bone. On the other side, the tissue fans out to attach at the base of each of your five toes. Plantar fasciitis is the name for the condition that develops when that tissue becomes inflamed. When the plantar fascia is excessively stretched, micro-tears can occur, causing this swelling and subsequent pain.</p>"}},"product_tab_cJ6ywP":{"type":"product-tab","blocks":{"collection_ByaUxA":{"type":"collection","settings":{"title":"SHOP WOMEN'S PLANTAR FASCIITIS","collection":"plantar-fasciitis-shoes"}},"collection_496wxM":{"type":"collection","settings":{"title":"SHOP MEN'S PLANTAR FASCIITIS","collection":"plantar-fasciitis-shoes"}}},"block_order":["collection_ByaUxA","collection_496wxM"],"disabled":true,"custom_css":[".nav-